@baseUrl = http://localhost:8888
@token = replace-with-jwt
@taskId = replace-with-task-uuid

### 新增巡检记录
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/inspection-records
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"taskId":"{{taskId}}","inspectionPart":"外立面","issueType":"OTHER","severity":"MEDIUM","summary":"发现局部破损","rectificationSuggestion":"安排复核并维修"}

### 完成任务
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/inspection-tasks/{{taskId}}/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
